🚽 Regression for #379: baka's formatter has the same %% bug.
🚽 baka writes to stderr; the test harness checks stderr when stdout is
🚽 empty, so this fixture produces no stdout. The grammar gives baka a
🚽 single expression -- no format args -- so only the no-args %% case
🚽 is reachable from Brainrot source.

skibidi main {
    baka("err 100%%");
    baka(" err%%");
    bussin 0;
}
